flowchart TB
 U[网页用户] --> WEB[Thymeleaf与JavaScript]
 PHONE[手机] -->|BLE蓝牙| ESP[ESP32-S3与LCD]
 WEB -->|HTTP与JSON| CTRL[Spring Boot控制器层]
 ESP -->|Wi-Fi与HTTPS| CTRL
 CTRL --> AGENT[AgentService智能体]
 CTRL --> SVC[天气、景点、路线、行程服务]
 AGENT --> STORE[ChatSessionStore内存会话]
 AGENT -->|本地适配或MCP| SVC
 AGENT --> MODEL[DashScope模型服务]
 SVC --> OM[Open-Meteo天气与地理编码]
 SVC --> AMAP[高德POI与路线]
 SVC -.计划新增持久化.-> DB[(MySQL数据库)]
 STORE -.计划迁移.-> DB
